    "title": "Yankees face a $23.15 million decision on their closer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Wilson ,\n10 hours ago\nThe Yankees have a $23.15 million decision to make before they know what their bullpen will look like next season. Closer David Bednar is eligible for free agency, and the qualifying offer gives New York a choice: risk paying a reliever that amount for one season or let him reach the market without the potential draft compensation attached to an offer.\nRead full article",
